  "subtitle_layout": {
    "checkedCaptions": 19,
    "allInsideSubtitleBand": true,
    "maxLines": 2,
    "captionLayouts": [
      {
        "text": "An empty handheld device can feel as if something is moving inside.",
        "x": 262.046875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1395.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "This is the actual mechanism, shown here as an animated computer model.",
        "x": 196.6875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1526.625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Your thumb and index finger meet these two contact surfaces.",
        "x": 325.953125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1268.078125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Each surface turns around its own pivot, while the frame and motor bodies stay in place.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "First, the two surfaces tilt together.",
        "x": 605.046875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 709.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "This shared motion provides a slow directional cue, linked to the position and apparent load of the virtual contents.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Now the surfaces tilt in opposite directions.",
        "x": 516.28125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 887.4375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Changing their difference adds a cue for shifting weight and inertia. The two motions can also be combined.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "Here, the gears carry motion from each motor to its contact surface.",
        "x": 264.359375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1391.265625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "We slow the animation so you can follow the rotation.",
        "x": 408.5625,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1102.875,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Four vibration elements provide the faster sensations: taps, collisions, and flowing texture.",
        "x": 105,
        "y": 939.15625,
        "width": 1710,
        "height": 110.6875,
        "bottom": 1049.84375
      },
      {
        "text": "The glowing markers show changing drive strength, not large physical movement.",
        "x": 123.609375,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1672.78125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Both outputs follow one virtual content state.",
        "x": 495.046875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 929.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "As this object moves toward a wall, the surfaces give a slower cue.",
        "x": 286.578125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1346.84375,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Its contact creates a brief vibration, while that slower cue continues.",
        "x": 268.546875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1382.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The same mechanism can suggest a marble, grains,",
        "x": 438.453125,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1043.078125,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "or liquid. The current content model moves in a two-dimensional cross-section.",
        "x": 151.546875,
        "y": 966.828125,
        "width": 1616.90625,
        "height": 55.34375,
        "bottom": 1022.171875
      },
      {
        "text": "These are illustrative commands, not measured hardware motion.",
